1
00:00:00,386 --> 00:00:01,196
(Howard:)What are you talking about?

2
00:00:01,353 --> 00:00:02,423
(Howard:)Remember last week,
when I asked you

3
00:00:02,588 --> 00:00:03,798
(Howard:)if you were wearing Spanx
and you weren't?

4
00:00:03,956 --> 00:00:05,696
(Howard:)How's that different?

5
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:09,100
(Bernadette:)Maybe you could try being
more thoughtful,

6
00:00:09,261 --> 00:00:10,711
(Bernadette:)like your friend Raj.

7
00:00:10,863 --> 00:00:13,243
(Howard:)Yeah, well, maybe you could
try being more like Raj.

8
00:00:13,399 --> 00:00:15,239
(Bernadette:)-Oh, really?
-Yeah, yeah.

9
00:00:15,401 --> 00:00:16,641
(Howard:)He packed me
a lunch this morning.

10
00:00:16,802 --> 00:00:19,872
(Howard:)And there was a note inside
that said, "Go get them."

11
00:00:20,873 --> 00:00:22,443
(Bernadette:)Like I don't do enough around here.

12
00:00:22,608 --> 00:00:23,778
(Bernadette:)Now I need to pack your lunch?

13
00:00:23,909 --> 00:00:25,409
(Bernadette:)And by the way, why do you need
a note telling you

14
00:00:25,577 --> 00:00:26,717
to go get them?
You're a grown man!

15
00:00:26,812 --> 00:00:28,122
You should know to "go get them!"

16
00:00:29,248 --> 00:00:30,488
I do know to "go get them,"

17
00:00:30,649 --> 00:00:32,249
(Howard:)but sometimes
it's nice to have emotional support

18
00:00:32,317 --> 00:00:34,317
when I'm going and getting them!

19
00:00:34,386 --> 00:00:36,996
(Raj:)Hey, hey, do you hear yourselves?

20
00:00:37,156 --> 00:00:40,326
(Raj:)Let's just, you know, all calm down
and take a step back.

21
00:00:41,894 --> 00:00:43,634
(Bernadette:)This is stupid.
Why are we fighting?

22
00:00:43,796 --> 00:00:44,676
(Sheldon:)I don't know.

23
00:00:44,830 --> 00:00:47,970
(Howard:)I guess I was just feeling
like I'm a lousy husband.

24
00:00:48,133 --> 00:00:49,473
(Bernadette:)You're not a lousy husband.

25
00:00:49,635 --> 00:00:50,775
(Raj:)You're a great husband.

26
00:00:50,936 --> 00:00:53,006
(Bernadette:)I was the one feeling
like a lousy wife.

27
00:00:53,172 --> 00:00:55,282
(Howard:)Are you kidding?
You're the best.

28
00:00:55,441 --> 00:00:56,821
(Howard:)I know what the problem is.

29
00:00:56,975 --> 00:00:59,025
It's him!

